2026-06-22 19:37:38,809 | AGENT | Orchestrator correct received: To address the client's requirements, our company Faber IA can leverage its existing capabilities in AI and innovation. We can design an AI-powered solution that incorporates retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) to provide drafting assistance for clinical and administrative content, such as discharge summaries, medical reports, and patient letters.

