Our solution will also provide assistance in analyzing and handling dossiers, surfacing relevant information, recalling applicable rules, and suggesting actions or verifications to support staff in their workflow. By integrating our AI-powered solution into the existing hospital information system (SIH) and electronic patient record (DPI), we can ensure seamless access to patient data and facilitate continuity of care between professionals and services.

In terms of innovation strategy, we propose an iterative approach, starting with a pilot phase on a limited perimeter, followed by progressive generalization to all services. This will allow us to refine our solution, address any technical or operational issues, and ensure that our AI-powered tool meets the evolving needs of the hospital staff.

Throughout the project, we will prioritize explainability, transparency, and data sovereignty, ensuring that our solution complies with relevant regulatory requirements, such as GDPR and French healthcare regulations. By leveraging our expertise in AI and innovation, we can deliver a tailored solution that enhances the efficiency, quality, and continuity of care, while supporting the hospital's digital transformation goals.
